<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Guaranty Trust Bank Q1 profit up slightly.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Guaranty Trust Bank Q1 profit up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter results for Guaranty Trust Bank Plc to end-May 1997 were announced on Thursday. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				1997	 1996</p>
<p>Gross earnings	    563.2  vs 558.4</p>
<p>Profit before taxation   176.6 vs 170.8</p>
<p>Profit after taxation    120.1 vs 116.1</p>
<p>($1=84.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
